## 性能优化

### 1. 查询优化

✅ **使用索引和缓存**
```php
// 使用索引字段查询
$user = User::where('uuid', $uuid)->find();

// 使用缓存
$cacheKey = 'user_' . $userId;
$user = cache($cacheKey);
if (!$user) {
    $user = User::find($userId);
    cache($cacheKey, $user, 3600);
}
```

### 2. 避免N+1查询

✅ **使用预加载**
```php
// ❌ N+1查询
$users = User::select();
foreach ($users as $user) {
    $roles = $user->roles;  // 每次都查询数据库
}

// ✅ 预加载
$users = User::with(['roles'])->select();
foreach ($users as $user) {
    $roles = $user->roles;  // 已经加载好了
}
```

